# Documentation updates

When changing user-visible behavior or architecture:

1. Update the relevant file in `docs/specs/`.
2. Update `docs/tracker/ROADMAP.yaml` item status or links.
3. Add an ADR under `docs/architecture/` for non-trivial decisions.
4. Ensure `scripts/validate-docs.sh` passes.
